    ('37552', 3, $$All by my self with no hair no family. I don’t belong in this world why are you crying bear asked Hippo. I don’t belong sir I have no family and no hair. Well you see in the jungle we all are family don’t worry be happy son.$$),
    ('37552', 4, $$Who dares to be weeping in my jungle a deep voice out of the sky appears to be the great wise owl. Listen closely now Bear do not fear the future be brave no one looks like you in this jungle embrace that. Life challenges us to make us strong$$),
